==English==
{{wikipedia|lang=en|Mind (disambiguation)}}

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*men-|id=think}}
From {{inh|en|enm|minde}}, {{m|enm|munde|münde}}, {{m|enm|ȝemünde}}, from {{inh|en|ang|gemynd|ġemynd|memory}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*mundi}}, {{m|gmw-pro|*gamundi}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*mundiz}}, {{m|gem-pro|*gamundiz||memory, remembrance}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*méntis||thought}} (compare also {{m|en|mantis}}, via Greek), from the root {{m|ine-pro|*men-||to think}}. 

Cognate with {{cog|goh|gimunt||mind, memory}}, {{cog|da|minde||memory}}, {{cog|sv|minne||memory}}, {{cog|is|minni||memory, recall, recollection}}, {{cog|got|𐌼𐌿𐌽𐌳𐍃||memory, mind}}, {{cog|la|mens|mēns|mind, reason}}, {{cog|sa|मनस्|tr=mánas}}, {{cog|grc|μένος}}, {{cog|sq|mënd||mind, reason}}. {{doublet|en|mantra}}. Related to {{cog|ang|myntan||to mean, intend, purpose, determine, resolve}}. More at {{l|en|mint#Etymology 3}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|mīnd|a=RP,GA}}, {{IPA|en|/maɪnd/}}
